# Cloudflare Web Analytics site token. Get one at
# https://dash.cloudflare.com -> Web Analytics -> Add a site (works for any
# domain, including GitHub Pages). Leave unset to disable analytics entirely.
# For the GitHub Pages deploy, set it as a repository variable named
# CF_BEACON_TOKEN (Settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions -> Variables).
NEXT_PUBLIC_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=
